  "description": "It was a political marriage. So, on his wedding night, he ran away. He lived for ten years under a new name, but upon hearing of his father’s death, he returned home. There, he found his wife, whom he had seen only once and assumed had already left, still there. She was as beautiful as ever.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
